# ============================================================
# RMPG Flex — Code Owners
# ============================================================
# Every path requires approval from its listed owner(s) before
# a PR can merge. Paths are evaluated most-specific first, so
# a more-specific rule below overrides a less-specific one above.
#
# Ownership tiers (single-owner org):
#   TIER 1 — Security-critical: auth, migrations, CI/CD, DO
#   TIER 2 — Operational-critical: dispatch, warrants, CAD core
#   TIER 3 — Law enforcement records: arrests, evidence, jail, intel
#   TIER 4 — Supporting services: fleet, billing, serve, CRM
#   TIER 5 — Client UI, edge AI, kiosk
#
# When team members are added, replace @rmpgutah on TIER 1/2 paths
# with the specific engineer(s) responsible for that subsystem.
# ============================================================

# ── Default: everything requires review ─────────────────────
* @rmpgutah

# ── TIER 1: Security-critical ───────────────────────────────

